  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice red onion.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 5-6 mins. Reduce heat to medium.\n• Stir in balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and splash of water. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63ffe30dda780720d7074e4f/step-86e404d2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm slices. Place in a bowl and cover with water to soak.\n• Roughly chop tomato. Grate carrot.\n• In a small bowl, combine mustard, the mayonnaise, honey and a drizzle of olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63ffe30dda780720d7074e4f/step-e179c31a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. In a medium bowl, combine roast seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil. Add haloumi and toss to coat.\n• Wipe out pan and heat to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine salad leaves, tomato, carrot, a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63ffe30dda780720d7074e4f/step-e32c8e6e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide salad between bowls. Top with haloumi and caramelised onion.\n• Drizzle with honey-mustard mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63ffe30dda780720d7074e4f/step-a2548fd2.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
